      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T19:18:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe it is our [state machine](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/fpsensor/fpsensor.cc;l\u003d199?q\u003dfpsensor.cc\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d198-,199,-200) that will modify the negative returned error into \n`EC_MKBP_FP_ERR_MATCH_NO_INTERNAL` in order to abort enrollment. \n\n[EC_MKBP_FP_ERR_MATCH_NO_INTERNAL](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/ec_commands.h;l\u003d4260?q\u003dEC_MKBP_FP_ERR_ENROLL_INTERNAL\u0026sq\u003d\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d4259-,4260,-4261) is a positive value.\n\n\nThe header of the [fp_finger_match](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/include/fpsensor/fpsensor_alg.h;l\u003d18#:~:text\u003d17-,18,-19) states that the function returns negative error on failure.",
